OL,3,GNEWSAWhitstable's 103-year-old bowling
OL,4,Alegend
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorman Tilley has been alive for longer
OL,7,Fthan his bowls club in Kent has been
OL,8,Festablished.
OL,10,FAt 103 years old, he is one of
OL,11,FWhitstable Bowling Club's most
OL,12,Ftreasured members, celebrating
OL,13,Fbirthdays there, organising club
OL,14,Fholidays and even winning trophies.
OL,16,FNorman's friends describe him as a
OL,17,F"legend".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
