OL,3,GNEWSAWhitstable's 103-year-old bowling
OL,4,Alegend
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He doesn't stop - he's just such a
OL,7,Fcharacter," said club officer Tracy
OL,8,FHamilton. "You've never met anybody
OL,9,Flike Norman and isn't it just
OL,10,Funbelievable that he's still bowling?"
